#!arguments-desc=HideCarousel: [轮播] 彻底移除轮播图\n移除首页与各专区横幅轮播图组件及四大落地推广（办宽带/智盒/摄像头/融合套餐），使其彻底消失而非仅阻断跳转\n\nHomeBasicClean: [首页] 基础净化\n清理首页瀑布流、推荐位与活动广告\n\nServicePageClean: [专区] 专区横幅净化\n清理话费/余量等业务专区横幅推广\n\nMineClean: [我的] 基础净化\n清理「我的」页面营销区域、签到浮窗与推荐卡片\n\nHideTopFamily: [首页] 隐藏-爱家\n隐藏首页顶部 Tab「爱家」\n\nHideTopAge: [首页] 隐藏-网龄\n隐藏首页顶部 Tab「网龄」\n\nHideTopPhone: [首页] 隐藏-手机\n隐藏首页顶部 Tab「手机」\n\nHideTopNearby: [首页] 隐藏-附近厅\n隐藏首页顶部 Tab「附近厅」\n\nHideTopAI: [首页] 隐藏-AI尝鲜\n隐藏首页顶部 Tab「AI 尝鲜」\n\nHideTopEnterprise: [首页] 隐藏-政企\n隐藏首页顶部 Tab「政企」\n\nHideMyCheckIn: [我的] 隐藏-签到浮窗\n隐藏「我的」签到浮窗（areaId 20230721008）\n\nHideMyMarketing: [我的] 隐藏-营销区域\n隐藏「我的」营销区域（areaId 20230721012）\n\nHideMyServices: [我的] 隐藏-我的服务\n隐藏「我的」我的服务（areaId 20230721018）\n\nHideMyFamilyCube: [我的] 隐藏-我的家庭\n隐藏「我的」我的家庭（areaId 20240708002）\n\nHideMyDevicesCube: [我的] 隐藏-我的设备\n隐藏「我的」我的设备（areaId 20251024002）\n\nHideMyMiniProgram: [我的] 隐藏-我的账户\n隐藏「我的」我的账户（areaId 20231017002）\n\nHideMyDigitalHuman: [我的] 隐藏-AI智能助理\n隐藏「我的」AI 智能助理（areaId 20230721020）\n\nHideMySelections: [我的] 隐藏-我的优选\n隐藏「我的」我的优选（areaId 20230721030）\n\nHideMyGroup: [我的] 隐藏-我的集团\n隐藏「我的」我的集团（areaId 20230721036）\n\nHideMyRingtone: [我的] 隐藏-我的彩铃\n隐藏「我的」我的彩铃（areaId 20251230002）\n\nHideMyCloudDrive: [我的] 隐藏-我的云盘\n隐藏「我的」我的云盘（areaId 20240624002）\n\nHideMyToolbox: [我的] 隐藏-百宝箱\n隐藏「我的」百宝箱（areaId 20230721044）\n\nHideMyLifeServices: [我的] 隐藏-生活服务\n隐藏「我的」生活服务（areaId 20230928004）

[Rule]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cmicapm.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dc.cmicapm.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jiguang.coc.10086.cn,REJECT

[Map Local]
(?i)^https?:\/\/(?:client\.app\.coc|app)\.10086\.cn\/biz-orange\/DN\/(?:explorePage\/getAdverList|init\/startInit|emotionMarket)(?:\?.*)?$ data-type=text data="" status-code=200

(?i)^https?:\/\/client\.app\.coc\.10086\.cn\/biz-orange\/(?:DN\/(?:dropsAdverService\/getDropsAdverNew|homepagePopup\/getSortInfo|toast\/getToastRule)|DH\/toast\/august\/getToast|DA\/liveSuspension\/getPageCode)(?:\?.*)?$ data-type=text data="{}" status-code=200 header="Content-Type:application/json"

[Script]
[中国移动]页面与轮播净化 = type=http-response, pattern=(?i)^https:\/\/(?:client\.app\.coc\.10086\.cn\/biz-orange\/(?:DN\/(?:homePage\/getTopAreaList|myPageNew\/getMyPageNew|multipleInterfaces\/aggregationData|init\/getNavigation|searchWord\/getSearchWordInfo)|DA\/baseServiceFunction\/getAdverList)|h\.app\.coc\.10086\.cn\/biz-orange\/DA\/baseServiceFunction\/getAdverList)(?:\?.*)?$, script-path=https://github.com/ifflagged/Romeo/raw/main/Modules/JavaScript/TomCatXue/ChinaMobile/TomCatXue_remove_ads.js, requires-body=true, timeout=10, argument=HideCarousel="{{{HideCarousel}}}"&HomeBasicClean="{{{HomeBasicClean}}}"&ServicePageClean="{{{ServicePageClean}}}"&MineClean="{{{MineClean}}}"&HideTopFamily="{{{HideTopFamily}}}"&HideTopAge="{{{HideTopAge}}}"&HideTopPhone="{{{HideTopPhone}}}"&HideTopNearby="{{{HideTopNearby}}}"&HideTopAI="{{{HideTopAI}}}"&HideTopEnterprise="{{{HideTopEnterprise}}}"&HideMyCheckIn="{{{HideMyCheckIn}}}"&HideMyMarketing="{{{HideMyMarketing}}}"&HideMyServices="{{{HideMyServices}}}"&HideMyFamilyCube="{{{HideMyFamilyCube}}}"&HideMyDevicesCube="{{{HideMyDevicesCube}}}"&HideMyMiniProgram="{{{HideMyMiniProgram}}}"&HideMyDigitalHuman="{{{HideMyDigitalHuman}}}"&HideMySelections="{{{HideMySelections}}}"&HideMyGroup="{{{HideMyGroup}}}"&HideMyRingtone="{{{HideMyRingtone}}}"&HideMyCloudDrive="{{{HideMyCloudDrive}}}"&HideMyToolbox="{{{HideMyToolbox}}}"&HideMyLifeServices="{{{HideMyLifeServices}}}"

[中国移动]消息与卡券横幅净化 = type=http-response, pattern=(?i)^https:\/\/h\.app\.coc\.10086\.cn\/biz-orange\/DH\/(?:message_query\/message\/query\/list|myCardVoucher\/getBannerList)(?:\?.*)?$, script-path=https://github.com/ifflagged/Romeo/raw/main/Modules/JavaScript/TomCatXue/ChinaMobile/TomCatXue_remove_ads.js, requires-body=true, timeout=10, argument=HideCarousel="{{{HideCarousel}}}"

[中国移动]横幅看板净化 = type=http-response, pattern=(?i)^https:\/\/app\.10086\.cn\/biz-orange\/DA\/commonBoard\/getCommonBoard(?:\?.*)?$, script-path=https://github.com/ifflagged/Romeo/raw/main/Modules/JavaScript/TomCatXue/ChinaMobile/TomCatXue_remove_ads.js, requires-body=true, timeout=10, argument=HideCarousel="{{{HideCarousel}}}"

[中国移动]陕西秦币凭据捕获 = type=http-request, pattern=(?i)^https?:\/\/sn\.clientaccess\.10086\.cn\/html5\/indivbusi\/, script-path=https://github.com/ifflagged/Romeo/raw/main/Modules/JavaScript/TomCatXue/ChinaMobile/TomCatXue_cmcc_cookie.js, requires-body=true

[中国移动]陕西秦币会话捕获 = type=http-response, pattern=(?i)^https?:\/\/sn\.clientaccess\.10086\.cn\/html5\/indivbusi\/(tokenLogin\/login|qinCoin\/), script-path=https://github.com/ifflagged/Romeo/raw/main/Modules/JavaScript/TomCatXue/ChinaMobile/TomCatXue_cmcc_cookie.js, requires-body=true

[MITM]
hostname = %APPEND% client.app.coc.10086.cn, h.app.coc.10086.cn, app.10086.cn, ad.mcloud.139.com, sn.clientaccess.10086.cn

